I went thru the same setup about a month ago!

Here are some of the problems I encountered (including the 
unwanted newsgroup) and their solutions:

1) Unwanted newsgroup:
   a) Make sure you have an entry in the "newsfeeds" file. 
      I am accepting comp.unix.* with
                ME:!*,comp.unix.*::
   b) Make sure you have added an entry in the "active" 
      file with the ctlinnd newgroup ... command (don't 
      forget to ctlinnd pause and ctlinnd go around the add
      (This is what caused the rejects ... all postings 
      fell in the junk group)

2) Cannot post:
   When creating your group the flag must be set to "y" 
   (see the ctlinnd newgroup command)
   Finally make sure you have your transmissions setup 
   properly.  I send back posts with:
     sunqbc.risq.net\
        :!*,comp.unix.*\
        :Tf,Wnm\
        :/users/tmp/news/out.going/sunqbc.risq.net
   (sunqbc is my newsfeed server)

Hope this helps,
and have fun,

/jean




