I do not have a 3000, I am running an Alpha 2100. The server auto-senses 
which port the cable is attached to and uses that port.  
I am assuming that you have a cable attached to the AUI port to a central
concentrator or have an AUI-10baseT converter attached to the AUI port and
that that line is 'LIVE' and
that you are not trying to use both the AUI and the 10baseT connectors at
the same time.
If the card will not auto-sense then get the hardware manual on the net
card and check to see if it requires a physical reset of configuration 
jumpers on the board to change which port it is going to use.
Good luck
