distribution: world
references: <3o8bq6$519@jac.zko.dec.com>,<3o8t52$g0d@eurybia.rz.uni-konstanz.de> <3od6gl$gjq@jac.zko.dec.com> <3p7q83$mqs@sgi.iunet.it>
organization: Digital Equipment Corporation, Nashua NH
