I suspect it is a "sparse" file.  If you need to copy it, but don't want the
copy to occupy additional space, use the "dd" command with conv=sparse.  Eg:

dd if=original of=copy conv=sparse

if memory serves me right.  See dd in man pages if this doesn't work.



