Assuming top V3.3 (Aug 30, 1993), you need to make 2 changes to machine.c.

1. Comment out the #include <machine/pte.h>.

2. Change line 82:
	{ "_mpid" },		/* 0 */
to:
        ( "_pidNPID" },		/* 0 */

That's all that is needed.
I'm afraid I have no idea about the TALK problem.

