 > : David.
 > 
 > you need to create a directory ~/ftp/etc/sia with the following files in it:
 > 
 > OSFC2_matrix.conf 
 > bsd_matrix.conf    
 > matrix.conf        
 > siainitgood
 > 
 > you can find these files under /etc/sia. 
 > 
 > Hope This Helps!
 > 
