Digital has announced DEC Fortran 90 V2.0 for OpenVMS Alpha Systems, the first
availability of DEC Fortran 90 for this platform.  DEC Fortran 90 V2.0 for
Digital UNIX Alpha Systems, an update of DEC Fortran 90 V1.3, is also
