You may remember a few weeks ago I had a query regarding InfoServer
support under Digital UNIX.  It transpired that although the InfoServer
was supported under OpenVMS and ULTRIX, the device could not be accessed
from Digital UNIX (OSF/1).


I complained in the strongest terms to both the UK technical support
service, and the UK Government Sales department in Digital, about this
lack of support.  

Those of you with InfoServers and Digital UNIX machines will be pleased
to know that Digital have accepted my complaint, and their engineering
department have agreed to provide support in a future release of the
InfoServer software.  This support, when implemented, will be given 
reference number QAR32714 on any Software Product Description sheets.

Thank you Digital!

Paul Howland
LSC2 Division
Defence Research Agency
Malvern, Worcs, UK



