Something slows down your computer :-( .The default time after a temp
file is deleted is 5 sec. The built-in default looks like this:
*unlinkDelay: 5000
(the time is given in ms).

Modify the default (put inside AsWedit or in .Xdefaults). First
try something like this:
        asWedit -xrm "*unlinkDelay: 20000"

Hope this will help.


